# Technician assignment, visits and intervention of a service ticket (#36, #37).
# Assign, plan, reschedule, close, technician calendar of others: Admin/Operator (TicketsManage).
# Own calendar, start, protocol, material, device replacement, verify: Admin/Operator/Technician (TicketsField);
# a technician acts only on own visits and tickets (404 otherwise).
# Confirm and reopen: Customer, own ticket only (TicketsConfirm). Times are ISO 8601; in a query string write Z or encode "+" as %2B.
# Port matches launchSettings.json (http profile).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@ticketId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@visitId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@technicianId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@deviceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Assign a technician (ticket in Triaged, RemoteDiagnosis or VisitScheduled)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/technician
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "technicianId": "{{technicianId}}" }

### Plan a visit (RemoteDiagnosis to VisitScheduled); 409 on collision with another visit of the technician
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/visits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "start": "2026-11-05T09:00:00Z", "estimatedMinutes": 90 }

### Visits of a ticket (a customer sees its own, without technician and findings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/visits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Visit detail with protocol, reschedule log, material and replaced devices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/{{visitId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change the date of a planned visit (the reason is required)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/{{visitId}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "start": "2026-11-06T13:00:00Z", "estimatedMinutes": 60, "reason": "Zákazník nie je doma" }

### My calendar (technician): visits starting in [from, to), at most 92 days
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/technicians/me/visits?from=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-30T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Calendar of any technician (planner)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/technicians/{{technicianId}}/visits?from=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-30T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Arrival on site (visit InProgress, ticket OnSite)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/{{visitId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Used material (replaces the whole list; only while on site)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/{{visitId}}/materials
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "materials": [ { "name": "DC konektor MC4", "quantity": 2, "unit": "ks" }, { "name": "Kábel 6 mm2", "quantity": 3.5, "unit": "m" } ] }

### Replace an installed device (same flow as POST /api/installations/{id}/devices/{deviceId}/replace) and link it to the visit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/{{visitId}}/device-replacements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}",
  "replacement": {
    "serialNumber": "INV-2026-0042",
    "manufacturer": "Fronius",
    "model": "Symo 10",
    "powerW": 10000,
    "reason": "Porucha výkonovej časti"
  }
}

### Service protocol (cause: InverterFault, PanelFault, WiringFault, GridIssue, Shading, Monitoring, NoFaultFound, Other); written once
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/{{visitId}}/report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cause": "InverterFault",
  "findings": "Invertor hlási chybu izolácie DC.",
  "workDone": "Vymenený DC konektor, reštart invertora.",
  "arrivedAt": "2026-11-05T09:00:00Z",
  "departedAt": "2026-11-05T10:15:00Z"
}

### Verify that production is restored (OnSite to Verified; needs the protocol)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Close the ticket (Verified or RemoteDiagnosis to Resolved to Closed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Výroba obnovená" }

### Customer confirms the fix
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "comment": "Funguje, ďakujem" }

### Customer reopens within 7 days of closing (back to RemoteDiagnosis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/reopen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Porucha sa vrátila" }
